    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπαθ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>enjoy oneself, make merry</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίνειν καὶ εὐπαθέειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.133
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				174
			</span></i>; <i>indulge oneself, live comfortably</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				347c
			</span></i>; of the soul, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρέφεται καὶ εὐπαθεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					247d
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυστυχέω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				56.45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>receive benefits</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπό
			τινος</span> from one, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.176b
			</span></i> (better divisim).</div>
